OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,6,Fsome sunny intervals. A mainly dry
OL,7,Fmorning then a few heavy showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,9,Fstrong southwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThere will be a mixture of
OL,12,Fclear spells and a few showers mainly
OL,13,Fin the west. Overnight some more
OL,14,Ffrequent showers across Perthshire and
OL,15,Fthe Trossachs. A windy night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,18,Fshowers, some heavy. Fresh to strong
OL,19,Fwesterly winds. On the cool side.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
